graph TD
    subgraph Data Sources [External Data Providers]
        DS1[NSE/BSE API - OHLCV] --> Ingest
        DS2[MoneyControl - Fundamentals & Deals] --> Ingest
        DS3[Trendlyne - Consensus & Ratios] --> Ingest
        DS4[GDELT / News Feeds] --> Ingest
    end

    subgraph Ingestion Layer [Data Ingestion & Pipeline]
        Ingest[Python Fetchers & Scrapers] --> PiT[PiT Alignment & Session Rolling]
        PiT --> DB[(PostgreSQL + TimescaleDB)]
    end

    subgraph Analytics & Modeling [ML Ensemble & Scoring]
        DB --> FE[Feature Store & PiT As-Of Joins]
        FE --> ME[Purged Walk-Forward ML Ensemble]
        ME --> UR[Unified Ranker & Smart Money Override]
    end

    subgraph Delivery & Frontend [Client Interface]
        UR --> API[FastAPI / Backend REST Service]
        API --> UI[React Frontend & Smart Money Desk]
    end

    subgraph Telemetry & Monitoring [Observability Stack]
        DB --> Health[Pipeline Health Checks & Freshness SLAs]
        Health --> Alert[Prometheus / Alertmanager / PagerDuty]
        Alert --> Slack[Slack / Telegram Webhook Ops]
    end
